01 · supersedes: HB-72\nFor employees who hold a team-lead role, 400 EUR per year is added to the standard annual training budget. Managers confirm claims for the annual training budget before payment in the next payroll run. Questions about the annual training budget go to the learning team, who keeps the record of decisions.\n[result-screen/1: kept 5 of 6 passages (2,171 of 2,577 chars); omitted HB-58 §1; unscreened: fetch(['HB-58 §1']) or /task/workspace/search-results/SR-002.txt]\n<<end search-result SR-002>>\n"
